===persian===

چرا...
عاشق‌تر از عاشقانِ جهان نباشم
من که در غم‌انگیزترین خاکِ زمین
سبز مانده‌ام...
و... در آرزوی خنده‌هایت
در فاصلهٔ دو انفجار... آواز خوانده‌ام...
در سایهٔ موشک‌ها...
بی قایق... بی‌اسب...
در آب و بر خاک رانده‌ام...
چرا با چهره و دستی گُشاده...
سرپا نباشم...
چرا عاشق‌تر از عاشقان دنیا نباشم؟...
۱۳۷۳

===machine===

Why...
should I not be more in love than the lovers of the world —
I who, in the most grief-stricken soil on earth,
have stayed green...
and... longing for your laughter,
in the gap between two explosions... have sung...
under the shadow of the missiles...
with no boat... with no horse...
have driven on the water and over the land...
Why, with an open face and an open hand...
should I not still be standing...
Why should I not be more in love than the world's own lovers?...
1373

===lantern===

Why
should I not be more in love than all the lovers of the world —
I who in the most grief-stricken soil on earth
have stayed green,
and who, wanting your laughter,
sang in the gap between two explosions,
under the shadow of the missiles,
with no boat and no horse
drove on over the water and the land?
Why, with an open face and an open hand,
should I not still be standing?
Why should I not be more in love than the world's own lovers?...

1373

